 class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center bg-gold-500 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-charcoal transition-all hover:bg-gold-600"
 >
 Request a Quote
 </a>
 </div>

 <h2 class="mt-12 mb-4 font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">The Short Version</h2>

 <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">
 Start with the employer hazard assessment and approved product specification. Build a role-based category list, compare bulk and store workflows, gather available artwork, forecast seasonal needs, and confirm all production and delivery terms in writing.
 </p>

 <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal">
 Write down who wears what and who can reorder it, and the next order gets easier.
 </p>

